data: {"type":"response.output_text.done","sequence_number":1069,"item_id":"msg_05a0988eee08bc29016b04129a27a887d197b6653a4e8ef8da","output_index":1,"content_index":0,"text":"{\"queries\":[],\"result_json\":\"{\\\"reviews\\\":[{\\\"actor\\\":\\\"lin\\\",\\\"decision\\\":\\\"develop\\\",\\\"ability\\\":null,\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Develop a minimal coordinate-specific, non-destructive worksite examination. Related capabilities were searched: probe supports nearby visible-subject observation or owned-sample tests, root-assessment requires an existing planted specimen, and root-planting-trial performs paid placement. None establishes an executable examination of an unplanted x/y footprint against the planting operation's substrate and clearance requirements. Reuse their applicable code rather than reinventing observation or planting checks. The reported local regime and terrain symbol do not establish conditions at the proposed patch; neither earlier rejection establishes its current cause.\\\",\\\"specification\\\":\\\"Current-conversation development handoff: implement soil-worksite-assessment with finite x/y inputs and one non-destructive examine mode. First support the actual footprint used by root-planting-trial@1; do not add arbitrary excavation, planting, sampling, or a site-search service. Dependencies and recorded code reuse: foundation-open@1 open.probe for grounded observation and evidence recording; root-planting-trial@1 long.root-planting for the exact footprint, ordinary-soil eligibility, interaction range of 0.65 plus body radius, and placement-clearance calculations. Extract a shared read-only evaluator if necessary; do not call a mutating planting handler or duplicate divergent rules. No prerequisite tools, root, or existing plot are required for accessible surface examination. Lin must independently study this ability and physically reach the nominated patch, using navigate separately at its existing costs if needed. Require a living actor, sufficient energy, valid in-bounds coordinates, and actual safe sensory/manual access. Examination costs one completed simulation round and 0.5 energy, charged once for the started physical attempt; no material is consumed or reserved. Do not deduct energy for an invalid invocation that never starts work. Light contact may establish accessible surface texture, but this precursor must not displace soil, clear objects, disturb organisms, expose buried material, or infer deeper composition. If those actions or equipment would be needed, report the specific unresolved constraint instead. Output a private, dated evidence record with exact x/y, examined footprint, actor, observation event IDs, method, observed surface findings, observable clearance evidence, and the applicable root-planting-trial@1 reference. Distinguish observed facts, rule-based interpretation, and unknowns. Only affirm or deny ordinary-soil suitability when physical evidence supports that interpretation; a terrain glyph alone is insufficient. Reuse authoritative spatial checks internally, but never disclose concealed occupants, resources, object IDs, or inaccessible substrate data. Unsupported causes remain unknown, not invented diagnoses. A fully observed overlap can be reported with exact visible object references; otherwise report only what examination established. Mark planting compatibility as provisional, time-stamped, and incomplete where necessary. Root availability and freshness remain separate planting prerequisites; assessment neither reserves the patch nor guarantees future placement. No root is taken from item-3-lin-12, no planting job starts, and no terrain, stock, ownership, mastery, nutrition, or protected account changes. At start retain an attempt ID, target footprint, paid cost and started state. Completion after the round records only performed observations. Interruption, explicit cancellation, or death ends this one-round attempt; it cannot resume as a completed inspection, gives no completion record, and refunds neither spent time nor energy. Preserve any already emitted actual observations as partial evidence only. A later attempt pays anew. There is no escrow, ongoing maintenance, automatic revisit, or persistent physical worksite; ordinary environmental and inventory ageing continue during executed simulation time. Review and implementation waiting advance no world time. Records can become stale and must not be silently updated. Other people receive findings only through actual communication and must independently examine or act for themselves. Encode validation, costs, completion, evidence filtering and cancellation in the handler rather than recurring model adjudication.\\\",\\\"learning\\\":1,\\\"experienceReview\\\":\\\"Functional information is the product; requesting, registration, studying, naming, and successful handler completion alone earn no pleasure or satisfaction. This precursor adds no new experience award or comfort effect. If the already implemented grounded-understanding rule accepts a genuinely verified, personally applicable observation or informative failure, use that single rule unchanged, including its existing bounded amount, cap, cooldown, decay and cross-ability evidence deduplication. Do not create a second award for the same fact through probe or root-assessment. Unresolved speculation and repeated unchanged checks do not become information-gain rewards. No protected reward accounts, budget, goals or permissions are altered, and basic nutrition is unchanged.\\\",\\\"visualReview\\\":\\\"Emit observable examination-start, examination-completed, interrupted, cancelled or failed events only when those transitions actually occur. Supply reusable metadata: attempt ID, actor ID, exact patch coordinates and footprint, phase, elapsed work, linked evidence IDs, and observed/unknown constraint statuses. Reuse a neutral inspection indicator and optional transient footprint outline; no terrain transformation or planted-root asset is created. Partial, inaccessible and failed checks must remain visibly distinct from completion. A completed examination may still show unknown or unsuitable findings and must never display successful planting, guaranteed suitability, hidden objects, or granted mastery.\\\"}]}\"}","logprobs":[]}

